  data: {
    LLM: 'Value the community card and its rank: if it pairs your hand or completes draws, you have hidden strength. Fold weak hands when the wild rank does not help you.\n\nTrack how many of the wild rank are already visible; adjust your draw and betting based on whether opponents can make trips or better. Bluff when the board favors your perceived range.\n\nBalance draw sizes to disguise hand strength; use position to check-raise or bet after the draw when the wild card creates ambiguous ranges.',
